 mpacts on culture\, society\, and creative industries.\n\nOrganisation: Om
 idyar Network\nLocation: Open to journalists and media organizations world
 wide.\nAward: $5\,000-$25\,000 per project. Rolling deadline through Decem
 ber 31\, 2026. No application fee.\nDuration: Per-project\; scope and time
