DTSTAMP:20261104T222340Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:Deadline: KU Leuven AI Safety Lab: Visiting Fellowships 2027 (Leuve
 n)
DESCRIPTION:First visiting-fellow cohort of the newly launched KU Leuven AI
  Safety Lab\, a multidisciplinary research group on large-scale risks of a
 dvanced AI (independent research\, policy workshops\, a summer school and 
 an annual conference).\n\nOrganisation: KU Leuven AI Safety Lab\nLocation:
  Leuven\, Belgium. Open internationally\; three months in residence.\nAwar
 d: EUR 2\,000 per month for three months\, covering accommodation and livi
