 e Collegium Prize for Innovation (USD 100\,000)\, the Citizens Workforce I
 nnovation Prize (USD 100\,000)\, the Crescent Enterprises AI for Social In
 novation Prize (USD 100\,000) and the Seeding the Future Prize (USD 150\,0
 00). No application fee.\nDuration: Nine-month support program\, plus perm
 anent Solver status with ongoing access to future opportunities.\n\nMore: 
